{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-0020-4000-8000-000000000000",
    "name": "Encargalo - Users",
    "description": "Endpoints de usuarios. Los endpoints protegidos requieren cookie `encargalo-session` con rol Customer o customer.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Register User",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Carlos\",\n  \"sur_name\": \"Ramírez\",\n  \"phone\": \"+573001112233\",\n  \"email\": \"carlos.ramirez@example.com\",\n  \"birthday_date\": \"1990-05-20\",\n  \"password\": \"claveSegura123\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/users",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["users"]
        },
        "description": "Registra un nuevo usuario. No requiere autenticación. Tras el registro crea la sesión automáticamente y retorna cookie `encargalo-session`."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Get Balance",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/balance",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["users", "balance"]
        },
        "description": "Retorna el balance del customer en USD y los últimos 10 movimientos. Créditos elegibles pueden incluir `can_request_refund`, `refundable_pm_usd`, `refund_eligible_until`. Débitos de devolución (`balance_refund_hold` / `processing` / `payout`) y créditos `balance_refund_restore` incluyen `refund_request_id` para abrir el detalle. Cookie + rol Customer."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Get Pago Movil",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/pago-movil",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["users", "pago-movil"]
        },
        "description": "Retorna el Pago Móvil registrado del customer para devoluciones. 404 si no tiene. Cookie + rol Customer."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Upsert Pago Movil",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"+584121234567\",\n  \"bank_code\": \"0102\",\n  \"national_id\": \"V12345678\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/pago-movil",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["users", "pago-movil"]
        },
        "description": "Crea o actualiza el Pago Móvil destino del customer. Requerido antes de solicitar devoluciones. Cookie + rol Customer."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Create Refund Request",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"transaction_id\": \"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/balance/refund-requests",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["users", "balance", "refund-requests"]
        },
        "description": "Solicita devolución en efectivo de la porción Pago Móvil de un crédito (> $1, ventana 15 min desde el crédito). Requiere PM registrado. Estados: pending → accepted → completed (staff sube proof_url). Cookie + rol Customer."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "List Refund Requests",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/balance/refund-requests",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["users", "balance", "refund-requests"]
        },
        "description": "Lista las solicitudes de devolución del customer. Cookie + rol Customer."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Get Refund Request Detail",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/balance/refund-requests/:id",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["users", "balance", "refund-requests", ":id"],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "id",
              "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Detalle de una solicitud. Cuando status=completed incluye proof_url del comprobante. Abrir desde el historial con refund_request_id. Cookie + rol Customer."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Staff Refund Requests WebSocket",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/staff/refund-requests",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["users", "staff", "refund-requests"]
        },
        "description": "WebSocket CRM staff. Al conectar: snapshot pending/accepted + connected. Inbound: accept {request_id}, reject {request_id, reason?}, complete {request_id, amount_usd, proof_image}. Preferir POST .../complete. Cookie + rol Staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Staff Complete Refund Request",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"amount_usd\": 52,\n  \"proof_image\": \"data:image/jpeg;base64,/9j/4AAQ...\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/users/staff/refund-requests/:id/complete",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["users", "staff", "refund-requests", ":id", "complete"],
          "variable": [
            {
              "key": "id",
              "value": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Staff marca accepted→completed. amount_usd debe coincidir (±0.01). proof_image es data-URL/base64; el API sube a Cloudinary. Cookie + rol Staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Get User",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/users",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["users"]
        },
        "description": "Retorna los datos del usuario autenticado. Requiere cookie `encargalo-session`. Roles: Customer, customer."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Update User",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          {
